<view class="page">
  <view class="page-header"><view class="page-title">订单与支付</view><view class="muted">把值得珍藏的时光，安排妥当。</view></view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">确认你的订单</view><text class="tag">微信支付</text></view>
    <view class="muted">订单金额、币种与状态会在支付前安全核验，支付结果以核验后的订单状态为准。</view>
    <label class="field-label">结算编号</label><input class="field" aria-label="结算引用" placeholder="填写本次订单的结算编号" value="{{checkoutId}}" bindinput="checkoutChanged" />
    <button class="button" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="pay">{{busy ? '正在核对订单' : '核对订单并发起支付'}}</button>
    <view class="divider" wx:if="{{amountText}}"></view><view class="page-title" wx:if="{{amountText}}">{{amountText}}</view>
    <view class="status" wx:if="{{stateText}}">{{stateText}}</view><view class="status error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="privacy-foot">支付完成后仍需核验订单结果。请勿重复支付，遇到问题可从“我的”联系支持。</view>
</view>
